#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:238 0a057e7dae854632873441fcbd87fb3e
msgid "Raw data conversion"
msgstr "原始数据转换"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:240 5bb61612ae044f689101068603ead0df
msgid ""
"The ADC measure/channel and the TDC channel numbers of a hit can be "
"converted into charge (raw energy) and time with `emc_adc_to_charge` and "
"`emc_tdc_to_time`:"
msgstr ""
"hit 的 ADC measure/channel 与 TDC 道数可用 `emc_adc_to_charge` 与 "
"`emc_tdc_to_time` 分别转换为电荷（原始能量）与时间："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:254 25742cbc858f4ef9a07d3ce855734371
msgid "The conversion formula of the charge is:"
msgstr "电荷的换算公式为："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:256 8eb65a446a764882a02b52d9654ea661
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{charge} = \\frac{\\text{adc}}{1024} \\times E_{\\text{measure}}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\text{charge} = \\frac{\\text{adc}}{1024} \\times E_{\\text{measure}}\n"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:260 f7ebd0b48c9344bc8e8598115ade807e
msgid ""
"where $adc$ is the charge channel number, $E_{\\text{measure}}$ is the "
"maximum energy of the corresponding measure:"
msgstr "其中 $adc$ 是电荷道数，$E_{\\text{measure}}$ 是相应 measure 的最大能量："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:262 5e09303d5ae0451fbf05caef55c80118
msgid ""
"\n"
"E_{\\text{measure}} =\n"
"    \\begin{cases}\n"
"        0.078~\\mathrm{GeV}, & \\text{measure} = 0 \\\\\n"
"        0.625~\\mathrm{GeV}, & \\text{measure} = 1 \\\\\n"
"        2.5~\\mathrm{GeV}, & \\text{measure} = 2 \\\\\n"
"        2.5~\\mathrm{GeV}, & \\text{measure} = 3 \\\\\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"E_{\\text{measure}} =\n"
"    \\begin{cases}\n"
"        0.078~\\mathrm{GeV}, & \\text{measure} = 0 \\\\\n"
"        0.625~\\mathrm{GeV}, & \\text{measure} = 1 \\\\\n"
"        2.5~\\mathrm{GeV}, & \\text{measure} = 2 \\\\\n"
"        2.5~\\mathrm{GeV}, & \\text{measure} = 3 \\\\\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:272 9dfb187d7a6f4464baa6b13f1f8a132a
msgid ""
"Note that `measure=3` indicates that the hit is saturated, and the charge"
" is calculated with the same formula as `measure=2`."
msgstr "注意 `measure=3` 表示该 hit 已饱和，其电荷按与 `measure=2` 相同的公式计算。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:274 12fbea501de54e43b03e69abd7085f20
msgid "Same as BOSS"
msgstr "与 BOSS 一致"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:277 bbde676e0e2a4301a3a4b4f7ed48d19f
msgid ""
"EMC charge calculation is the same as the one given by "
"`RawDataUtil::EmcCharge` in `BOSS`, except that the charge is in GeV in "
"`pybes3`, while it is in MeV in `BOSS`."
msgstr ""
"EMC 的电荷计算与 `BOSS` 中 `RawDataUtil::EmcCharge` 给出的结果一致，区别在于 `pybes3` 中电荷以 "
"GeV 为单位，而 `BOSS` 中以 MeV 为单位。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:280 fbcdac950d514976bf04a38a60b04d2c
msgid "The conversion formula of the time is:"
msgstr "时间的换算公式为："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:282 ecc0cf65fc17468eb58eb6414e3e7d79
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times 50~\\mathrm{ns}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times 50~\\mathrm{ns}\n"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:286 d7694171d8ba4220b8261245aaecc25b
msgid "Different from BOSS"
msgstr "与 BOSS 不同"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/emc.md:289 c841de0678124e79b70c30eab6f774c8
msgid ""
"EMC time calculation is different from the one given by `RawDataUtil` in "
"`BOSS`. In `RawDataUtil` it simply multiplies the time channel number by "
"1 without any unit conversion, while in `pybes3` it multiplies by 50 ns."
msgstr ""
"EMC 的时间计算与 `BOSS` 中 `RawDataUtil` 给出的结果不同。`RawDataUtil` 只是把时间道数乘以 "
"1、不做任何单位换算，而 `pybes3` 中乘以 50 ns。"

